OL,3,GNEWSACompany developing HQ site vows to
OL,4,A'keep listening'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer that has knocked down a
OL,7,Fcomplex used by the former Berkshire
OL,8,FCounty Council said it will "keep
OL,9,Flistening" to residents following
OL,10,Fconcerns over disruption.
OL,12,FThe authority, which was abolished in
OL,13,F1998, used Shire Hall at the Shinfield
OL,14,FArms roundabout from 1981. The site was
OL,15,Fused by two other companies before it
OL,16,Fshut in 2024.
OL,18,FWrenbridge secured planning permission
OL,19,Ffrom Wokingham Borough Council last
OL,20,Fyear to use the site for five
OL,21,Fwarehouse-style business and industrial
OL,22,Fbuildings.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
