OL,3,GNEWSACompany developing HQ site vows to
OL,4,A'keep listening'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut director Robin Means said it takes
OL,7,Fworries from neighbours over noise,
OL,8,Fdust and vibrations "seriously" and
OL,9,Fsaid the heaviest, most disruptive work
OL,10,Fhas been completed.
